>
  <h1>About this site</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Tidy Magpie makes small reference sites that collect scattered facts and keep them in order. This one covers Petit
    Planet, HoYoverse's planet life sim.
  </p>

  <h2>What you will find here</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Launch facts: dates, platforms and codes.</li>
    <li>Every known neighbor, with gifts, birthday and home galaxy.</li>
    <li>Tools that save you tabbing between pages: a gift finder, a birthday calendar file and a launch checklist.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What you will not find</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Guesses presented as facts. Unknown fields say they are unknown.</li>
    <li>Game artwork, screenshots or copied text from other guides.</li>
    <li>Accounts, sign-ups or pop-ups.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How it is made</h2>
  <p>
    The site is built and maintained with the help of AI tools, under human direction. Data is compiled from public
    sources, compared across English and Chinese-language material, and listed with its origin on the
    <a href="/sources/">sources page</a>. After launch, entries are re-checked against the released game.
  </p>

  <h2>Not official</h2>
  <p>
    This is an unofficial fan project. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by HoYoverse or miHoYo, and all game names
    and trademarks belong to their owners.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Corrections and suggestions: email <a href="mailto:hello@tidymagpie.com">hello@tidymagpie.com</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
